  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: Nothing's changed, apart from everything.",
    "H2: Less hype. More impact.",
    "H2: Aiimi at a glance.",
    "H2: Service Excellence at our core.",
    "H2: We are the bridge between data and decisions.   Delivering insight with purpose, intelligence with integrity, ",
    "H2: Meet the team.",
    "H2: Get to know us better.",
    "H2: Are you a software or services business?",
    "H2: I just need a specialist squad to solve  a specific problem – can you help?",
    "H2: If I buy your AI platform, do I have to buy your services too?",
    "H2: Can I run your platform on-premises, or is it cloud-only?",
    "H2: Do you offer product support?",
    "H2: Do you work with partners?",
    "H2: What’s Aiimi’s approach to sustainability and net zero?",
    "H2: Which accreditations and certifications does Aiimi hold?",
    "H2: Talk to us."
  ],
  "bodyText": "Nothing's changed,\napart from everything.\n\nSince Aiimi was founded, we’ve been on a single-minded mission to unlock the full potential of data and AI in every enterprise.\n\nWorkplace AI Platform\nExpert Services\nLess hype. More impact.\n\n​AI is changing the world, and Aiimi stands at the forefront of these new technologies. But real-world business problems haven't changed – and neither has our approach. We're bringing more firepower to the same mission; solving complex challenges with sharper tools, accelerated delivery, and richer outcomes.\n\nJoin our team\nAiimi at a glance.\nBritish software and services company, with our HQ in Milton Keynes.\nIndependently owned and run since our founding in 2007.\nWorkplace AI that's built for the enterprise. Expert squads that are embedded in your organisation.\nSpecialists in AI, Data Governance, Digital, Search, Content Management, Privacy & Compliance.\nProven industry expertise in Government, Utilities, Water, Engineering, Financial Services, Manufacturing.\nDrive rapid time to value through agile methodologies and innovation.\nTrusted by the world’s most prestigious organisations.\nPartner to the best of the best, including Microsoft, Databricks, Neo4j, Elastic, PwC.\nService Excellence\nat our core.\n\nAt Aiimi, Service Excellence is not just something we do – it's part of who we are. Our collective commitment to service is guided by reliability, responsiveness, and relationships, with a clear, research-backed framework to measure customer satisfaction and connect service to processes and systems. It enables us to align our people practices ​around consistent behaviours and expectations, and helps everyone at Aiimi speak the same language when it comes to service.​\n\nWe are the bridge between data and decisions. Delivering insight with purpose, intelligence with integrity, and transformation with trust.\nMeet the team.\nSteve Salvin\n\nCEO & Founder\n\nLee Hewett\n\nChief Operating Officer\n\nPaul Maker\n\nCTO\n\nBecky Trowell\n\nHR Director\n\nLisa Salvin\n\nChief Finance & People Officer\n\nMark Drayton\n\nChief Customer Officer\n\nBen Sprague\n\nChief of Staff\n\nMike Hull\n\nAiimi Services Director\n\nChris Murray\n\nHead of Engineering\n\nGet to know us better.\nAre you a software or services business?\n\nWe're both - we’ve built a powerful workplace AI platform and a team of world-class experts offering services and resource augmentation for AI, data, and digital. Together, they achieve great things for our customers.\n\nI just need a specialist squad to solve a specific problem – can you help?  \nIf I buy your AI platform, do I have to buy your services too?\nCan I run your platform on-premises, or is it cloud-only?\nDo you offer product support?\nDo you work with partners?\nWhat’s Aiimi’s approach to sustainability and net zero?\nWhich accreditations and certifications does Aiimi hold?\nTalk to us.\n\nWe're here to help, whether you want a quick chat or a personalised demo from one of our experts. Just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
}